{"index": {"_id": "/us/ca/cities/san-mateo/code/23.06.017", "_type": "page"}}
{"body": "City of San Mateo Municipal Code. 23.06.017 TEMPORARY BUILDING. Real estate sales and leasing of the building or buildings under construction may be conducted from a temporary structure located on the construction site, subject to the conditions and procedures established in Section 26.04.130 of this code. ( Ord. No. 2016-10 \u00a7 1 ; Ord. No. 2013-13 \u00a7 1 ; Ord. No. 2007-11 \u00a7 1; Ord. No. 1999-8 \u00a7 2; Ord. No. 1992-12 \u00a7 1; Ord. No. 1990-1 \u00a7 1; Ord. No. 1988-4 \u00a7 1; Ord. No. 1985-4 \u00a7 1; Ord. No. 1981-23 \u00a7 1.)", "num": "23.06.017", "path": "library|City of San Mateo, Cal., Code|23|23.06|23.06.017", "title": "23.06.017 TEMPORARY BUILDING.", "url": "/us/ca/cities/san-mateo/code/23.06.017"}
{"index": {"_id": "/us/ca/cities/san-mateo/code/23.06.020", "_type": "page"}}
