{"body": "City of San Mateo Municipal Code. 23.06.040 APPEALS. [Repealed] Repealed. ( Ord. No. 2019-13 \u00a7 1(a) ; Ord. No. 2016-10 \u00a7 1 ; Ord. No. 2013-13 \u00a7 1 ; Ord. No. 2013-2 \u00a7 3 ; Ord. No. 2010-16 \u00a7 1 ; Ord. No. 2007-11 \u00a7 1.)", "num": "23.06.040", "path": "library|City of San Mateo, Cal., Code|23|23.06|23.06.040", "title": "23.06.040 APPEALS.\n[Repealed]", "url": "/us/ca/cities/san-mateo/code/23.06.040"}
