{"body": "City of San Mateo Municipal Code. 23.28.250 VIOLATIONS. It is unlawful to violate or fail to comply with any provisions of this code, or violate or fail to comply with any order made under this code or to build in violation of any detailed statement of specification or plans submitted and approved under this code, or any certificate or permit issued under this code. ( Ord. No. 2016-12 \u00a7 3 .)", "num": "23.28.250", "path": "library|City of San Mateo, Cal., Code|23|23.28|23.28.250", "title": "23.28.250 VIOLATIONS.", "url": "/us/ca/cities/san-mateo/code/23.28.250"}
